<title>CHINA: Chun Wo yearly profit up 26.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Chun Wo yearly profit up 26.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  16.1     vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   5	  vs 4.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			   66.07    vs 52.21</p>
<p>    Turnover		    2,636.36 vs 1,594.82</p>
<p>    Company name		Chun Wo Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 Sept 18-24</p>
